// ---- felt252_mul_raw_spec: split-function math-correctness layer ----
//
// The 8x8 schoolbook product (16-limb output) is too deep for Z3 to
// auto-discharge as 16 ensures in a single function -- the combined
// SMT query exceeds practical timeouts. Decomposing into 16 separate
// per-limb functions, each with a single ensures, gives Z3 16 small
// independent queries that each discharge in ~2-4s.
//
// Each mul_raw_limb_k(a, b) returns the k-th limb of the 16-limb
// product as u32, with the projection-style ensures verified.
// felt252_mul_raw_spec composes them into the full 16-tuple.

